@startuml
title Tasks and Notifications Flow (AH-OSP-tasks)
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "Standard User" as User
actor "Super User" as SuperUser
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "External API (Orders/Inventory)" as API
participant "Notification Service" as NotifyAPI

== Order Approval Task Flow ==

User -> Browser: Finalize Order (w/o direct permissions)
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/checkout
BFF -> API: Check Permissions (Permessi invio ordine?)
API -> BFF: Lacks Permission -> Requires Approval
BFF -> API: POST /orders/request-approval
API -> BFF: Approval Task Created
BFF -> NotifyAPI: Create Task/Notification for Super User
BFF -> Browser: Show "Request Sent to Super User"

SuperUser -> Browser: Access Application
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/notifications
BFF -> NotifyAPI: Fetch Pending Tasks
NotifyAPI -> BFF: List of Pending Approvals
BFF -> Browser: Display Task in Header (Notifiche)

SuperUser -> Browser: Open Task & Approve Order
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/tasks/{id}/approve
BFF -> API: POST /orders/{id}/finalize
API -> BFF: Order Successfully Created
BFF -> NotifyAPI: Resolve Task & Create Notification for Standard User
BFF -> Browser: Success Message

User -> Browser: Refresh / Check Notifications
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/notifications
BFF -> Browser: Display "Order Approved & Processed"

== Restock Notification Flow (Farmaco nuovamente disponibile) ==

User -> Browser: View Out of Stock Product
User -> Browser: Click "Notify me when available"
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/products/{id}/watch
BFF -> NotifyAPI: Register Restock Subscription
BFF -> Browser: Subscription Confirmed

note over API, NotifyAPI: Time passes... Inventory updates
API -> NotifyAPI: Webhook: Product ID is now In Stock
NotifyAPI -> NotifyAPI: Generate notifications for subscribed users

User -> Browser: Logs in or polls
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/notifications
BFF -> NotifyAPI: Fetch unread notifications
NotifyAPI -> BFF: "Product X is back in stock"
BFF -> Browser: Display Notification Toast / Badge

== Order Status Update Notifications ==

note over API, NotifyAPI: Order moves to In Lavorazione / Spedito
API -> NotifyAPI: System Event: Order Status Changed
NotifyAPI -> NotifyAPI: Generate status update notification

User -> Browser: Check Dashboard
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/notifications
BFF -> Browser: "Order #12345 is now Spedito"

@enduml
